# ---- MCMC output --------------------------------------------------------
# Fitted posterior samples are large (tens of MB) and fully regenerable by
# re-running the scripts. Keeping them out of history avoids permanent repo
# bloat. Figures and summary tables under output/ ARE tracked, since they are
# small and serve as a record of each fit.
*.rds

# ---- R session artefacts ------------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj
.Rproj.user/
*_cache/
*-Ex.R

# NIMBLE compiles model code to C++ in a temporary project directory
nimble_generatedCode*/

# ---- Editor / IDE (machine-specific) ------------------------------------
.posit/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Claude Code local settings (per-machine permissions, not shared config)
.claude/settings.local.json

# ---- OS junk ------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
._*

# ---- Misc ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
